<%#
  Shown when a customer has a saved payment source for this method.

  Square tokens from the Web Payments SDK are single-use, so
  SquareCreditCard#reusable_sources returns [] and this should never render in
  practice. It exists because Solidus requires the partial to exist for the
  partial_name, and a MissingTemplate at checkout would be far worse than an
  unused file.
%>
<% card = wallet_payment_source.payment_source %>

<div class="square-existing-payment">
  <%= card.cc_type.presence&.titleize || "Card" %>
  <% if card.last_digits.present? %>ending <%= card.last_digits %><% end %>
  <p class="text-body-xs opacity-75">
    You'll be asked to re-enter your card, as we don't store card details.
  </p>
</div>
